#: submissions/sections.py:118
msgid "healthcare_plans.introduction"
msgstr "We would like to know if you and your child have received formal support in managing their diabetes alongside their education."

#: submissions/sections.py:125
msgid "q13.parent.title"
msgstr "Does your child have a school healthcare plan specifically for their diabetes?"

#: submissions/sections.py:127
msgid "q13.hint"
msgstr "This is a plan made with your diabetes team and school. It could be an informal or a formal plan, such as Individual Healthcare Plans (IHP), Records of Needs, or Education, Health and Care Plans (EHCP)."

#: submissions/sections.py:139
msgid "q14.parent.title"
msgstr "Does the school healthcare plan that's in place cover all your child's diabetes needs at school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:148
msgid "q15.parent.title"
msgstr "Does your child's school have a direct contact within your child's diabetes team if they need advice or support?"

