msgid "q27.child.title"
msgstr "Are your absences for diabetes-related appointments authorised by your school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:294
msgid "q27.parent.title"
msgstr "Are your child's absences for diabetes-related appointments authorised by their school?"

#: submissions/sections.py:296
msgid "q27.hint"
msgstr "School absences due to health appointments should not be classed as unauthorised."

